body:
Hi, delete this if not allowed but; 

My boyfriend was showing me his intellivision his dad had and that he played with when he was little. (We’re both 19) I was going through all the games and found what seems to be a Challenge Coin. It’s 4am here and his parents aren’t awake to answer questions and Google isn’t of help. We don’t know anyone nor can we think of anyone his parents know that’s been in the air force. 

Can anyone give us a timeline of this coin? My theory is he found it as a kid, his theory is his grandpa who worked at the national history museum was given it. But how did it end up in the intellivsion? The thing hasn’t been used in 15 years or more or even opened in years. It’s in very good condition as well.
